WEBVTT

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:11.450
I get it!

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.740
So if I use this formula here...

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:16.630
Wrong!

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:19.750
Geez, how many times must I explain this?

00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:23.300
I hate math.

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:29.830
<i>It is almost time for everyone to leave the Umesato Junior High local network.</i>

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:34.640
<i>Please save the files you are working on and link out.</i>

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:36.160
<i>I repeat.</i>

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:36.840
<i>It is almost time...</i>

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.320
Time's up.

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.140
You can continue working on your own.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:42.430
Meow! You heartless person!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:45.400
Link Out.

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:48.560
Huh?

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:54.660
No way. I can't even do it manually.

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:57.870
Perhaps the gods want you
to help me with my homework.

00:00:57.870 --> 00:00:59.480
Don't be silly.

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:03.190
We'll be punished if we're still in school after it closes.

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:07.480
What's happening?

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:10.760
No way! What's happening now?

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:12.420
It's coming this way. Run!

00:01:16.990 --> 00:01:17.840
Fight.

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:19.530
Don't run.

00:01:22.190 --> 00:01:24.020
Trick or Trigger!

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:32.690
No! What's this?!

00:03:32.550 --> 00:03:34.650
I'm gonna be late!

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:40.800
My breakfast!

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:46.600
Morning, Haru.

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:47.900
Did you know?

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:52.980
The finder of a lost article can take 20% of it as a reward.

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:54.100
Huh?!

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:56.740
W-Well... 5%, then!

00:03:56.740 --> 00:04:01.220
A selfish person like you gets to lose 20% as divine punishment!

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:03.620
Morning.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:07.290
K-Kuroyukihime-senpai!

00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:12.060
Friendly together early in the
morning, as usual. How nice.

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:15.070
Sorry! I apologize! Never again!

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:16.990
It's all my fault!

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:19.270
Haru, what's that supposed to mean?

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:22.450
O-Oh right! I'm on morning duty today.

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:24.570
See you later!

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:32.110
Hurry?

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:34.290
K, I'll give you a ride to school.

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:36.290
P-Pard-san.

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:42.220
Hey, Haru!

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:47.250
Geez, you're always being helped by girls!

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:51.570
Why did you show up out of the blue?

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:54.190
The Red King has a message for the Black King.

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:56.450
"Beware of the network troublemaker."

00:04:57.450 --> 00:04:59.430
Why are you telling me?

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:02.020
Like, why didn't you tell her directly?

00:05:02.810 --> 00:05:04.370
Because it's fun?

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:05.660
Why is it a question?!

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:06.560
NP.

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:11.490
No, there's a problem! A huge problem!

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:23.590
Calling me here with a sudden, brief message...

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:27.260
Senpai must be angry with me.

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:32.300
Ow...

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:38.130
Hello, Arita-kun.

00:05:38.130 --> 00:05:40.360
H-Hello.

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:45.460
Princess told me already, so don't worry.

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:47.460
You guys have a meeting, right?

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:49.260
S-Sorry!

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:50.830
You really don't need to care about me!

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:55.000
Arita-kun, you must really like apologizing.

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:58.090
No, not really.

00:05:58.090 --> 00:06:03.240
It's just that I often end up having to...

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:08.130
That's right, Princess was in a
slightly bad mood all morning.

00:06:08.730 --> 00:06:10.410
Do you have any idea why?

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:12.940
A-Any idea?

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:17.910
Th-There's no way someone like me
would know about Kuroyukihime-senpai-

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:21.990
Arita-kun, you're always treating Princess as your superior.

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:23.900
B-But of course!

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:33.370
I'll confess.

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:36.760
I'm a little jealous of you.

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:37.370
Huh?

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:45.100
Yes, because cabling with her and walking to school together have always been my sole privileges.

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:47.300
Until you came along.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:50.130
Th-That's not how it is, Wakamiya-senpai!

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:53.780
My relationship with Kuroyukihime-senpai is... uh...

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:56.420
Our interests happen to match, basically.

00:06:56.420 --> 00:06:58.230
We're like mentor and student.

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:04.340
There are no personal feelings involved at all, whatsoever, absolutely!

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:12.450
Sorry, I'm late.

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:15.100
I had some business in the staff room...

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:16.910
Wait... huh?

00:07:18.460 --> 00:07:19.490
What's wrong?

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:30.530
I called you all here for one reason.

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:33.010
I need your help on something.

00:07:34.340 --> 00:07:38.890
Recently, certain incidents have been occurring on the school network.

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:40.370
Any of you heard about it?

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:41.430
No.

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:43.480
What about you, Chii-chan?

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:44.060
Huh?

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:46.730
Oh, I didn't hear anything either.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:50.120
Um, Niko had a message for you.

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:52.820
"Beware of the network troublemaker" or something.

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:54.220
What's that, Haru?

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:56.940
You've been in touch with the Red King the whole time?

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:58.310
I haven't!

00:07:58.310 --> 00:08:01.360
Pard-san asked me to pass on the message earlier.

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:04.620
Right, and she let you ride on the back of her motorbike.

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:06.790
That's true, but...

00:08:09.110 --> 00:08:10.210
That's all.

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:12.920
I'll ask her about it later.

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:18.150
This might also be occurring in schools besides Umesato Junior High.

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:20.100
That would mean...

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:21.480
Yeah.

00:08:21.970 --> 00:08:30.030
Students are being trapped in the school network after school
and having their avatars' clothes and items stripped.

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:40.540
Armored, uses a gun, and has a pumpkin head?

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:41.870
Yeah.

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:45.030
He even broke the restriction on inappropriate contact.

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:48.790
But Senpai, why ask us?

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:50.130
There are three reasons.

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:54.740
First, our opponent seems to be using a non-system weapon.

00:08:54.740 --> 00:08:58.640
If that's true, this will likely be too much for student council members to handle.

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:06.650
Second, if this becomes serious, the authorities might get involved, restricting the power of the student council.

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:08.950
I'd like to avoid that if possible.

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:12.650
Something like the Noumi incident might happen again.

00:09:13.260 --> 00:09:14.720
And third...

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:20.490
There's nobody I trust more than the three of you.

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:23.060
I can't forgive avatar theft.

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:25.510
I'll do anything I can to help!

00:09:25.510 --> 00:09:27.530
I'll help too, of course.

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:30.670
As for Haru... well, the answer's obvious.

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:33.890
Y-Yeah, I uh...

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:36.760
I simply listen to Senpai's orders.

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:43.180
Then I'll see you after school, Takumu-kun, Chiyuri-kun.

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:43.890
Okay.

00:09:56.240 --> 00:10:01.910
<i>So this avatar thieving really is
occurring in other schools as well?</i>

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:03.060
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:06.840
<i>I've gathered the information together, but it doesn't make sense.</i>

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:07.870
<i>What do you mean?</i>

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:13.750
<i>He effortlessly infiltrates secure school networks, leaving no traces behind.</i>

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:16.350
<i>He must be a skilled hacker.</i>

00:10:16.350 --> 00:10:21.200
<i>But if you look at his actions, he simply
strips avatars of their clothing and items.</i>

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:24.630
<i>The disparity between his modus operandi and aim is quite creepy.</i>

00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:26.640
<i>It makes you not want to interfere.</i>

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:28.290
<i>I see.</i>

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:30.600
<i>Thank you for the information.</i>

00:10:31.570 --> 00:10:33.690
<i>How can I repay you?</i>

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:35.570
<i>Let's see.</i>

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:38.530
<i>I'll take Silver Crow, then.</i>

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:43.850
<i>I see.</i>

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:45.250
<i>I'll think about it.</i>

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:48.040
Huh?!

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:55.010
<i>Well, he might feel a lot more comfortable with you.</i>

00:10:55.850 --> 00:10:57.720
<i>Wait right there, Blacky!</i>

00:10:57.720 --> 00:10:58.980
<i>Just kidding.</i>

00:10:58.980 --> 00:10:59.970
<i>Forget about it.</i>

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:05.680
What's wrong with her?

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:09.720
Kouzuki-san, would you like to help me move these teaching materials?

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:10.730
Yes!

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:13.270
I'd love to, Sensei!

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:20.780
<i>It is almost time for everyone to leave the Umesato Junior High local network.</i>

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:23.740
<i>Please save the files you are working on and link out.</i>

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:25.630
<i>I repeat.</i>

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:28.850
Will he come?

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:31.270
Who knows? Nothing's happened yet.

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:34.320
By the way, you're pretty quiet today, Haru.

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:37.200
I've been screwing up in front of her all day today.

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:40.660
I think Kuroyukihime-senpai's mad at me.

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:42.000
Mad?

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:44.600
Doesn't look like that to me.

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:46.880
What do you mean?

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:48.300
I don't know.

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:54.100
And if I was that knowledgeable on how women's minds work, I wouldn't be having so much trouble myself.

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:56.000
Good point.

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:59.630
Seriously, girls are impossible to understand.

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:07.830
Chiyuri-kun, let me ask you something.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:08.450
Yes?

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:13.350
Am I really that oppressive?

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:15.420
Do I make people nervous?

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:17.420
What?

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:21.960
Haruyuki-kun always shrinks back in my presence.

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:23.300
It's painful to see.

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:30.560
Well, it's true that you aren't the easiest person to approach.

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:32.040
Really?

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:35.370
Uh, I'm afraid so.

00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:37.320
I see.

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:39.490
So it really is my fault.

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:43.950
But in this case, it's more Haru's fault than-

00:12:51.130 --> 00:12:52.250
Senpai.

00:12:52.770 --> 00:12:53.620
Yeah.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:58.540
Trick or Trigger!

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:01.460
Commence the plan!

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:02.760
Roger!

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:08.250
Taku!

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:14.180
I got you!

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:15.690
Welcome, Lantern-chan!

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:17.580
Here I go!

00:13:24.540 --> 00:13:26.570
It's over for you, damn pumpkin!

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:31.080
We did it!

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:36.290
Nice trigger.

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:38.000
A girl?!

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:46.560
Like hell I'd lose in an FPS!

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:56.770
Senpai!

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:12.330
Gate Open!

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:28.060
Huh?

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:29.430
My body feels so light.

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:33.610
Sorry, Takkun.

00:14:33.610 --> 00:14:36.020
Nah, I'm glad you're safe-

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:39.830
Senpai!

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:42.630
Looks like the gravity is weak here.

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:44.110
But where exactly are we?

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:47.800
This doesn't seem to be the school network.

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:49.470
Chii-chan, hurry up and get off me.

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:51.570
What? Are you saying I'm heavy?

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:56.410
Welcome to Accel Assault.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:58.890
Who are you?

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:00.960
My name is Dushka 30.

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:03.420
I am the last remaining Assault Linker.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:05.210
Assault Linker?

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:09.220
I've finally found you, my opponent.

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:13.550
Assault Link!

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:30.280
Now for round two.

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:36.910
Start!

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:45.290
Whoa, whoa!

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:46.500
Ow!

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:48.630
No!

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:49.610
Chiyu!

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:50.420
Chii-chan!

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:54.250
The clock isn't moving.

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:56.050
Is this place really...

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:08.070
Senpai!

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:18.480
Everyone, imagine your duel avatars.

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:19.910
And shout.

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:21.660
Burst Link!

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:26.920
Senpai, you're amazing!

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:29.020
I see, this place is-!

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:31.770
The Accelerated World, probably.

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:36.430
This field is different from Brain Burst, but it's controlled by similar rules.

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:38.440
Right, I see!

00:16:38.900 --> 00:16:40.490
Burst Link!

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:47.690
All right, us too!

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:49.000
Yeah.

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:50.860
Burst Link!

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:01.540
What the hell?!

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:03.550
You guys weren't focused enough!

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:07.460
Call! Elemental Bullet!

00:17:15.770 --> 00:17:17.510
There are too many!

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:18.610
Chii-chan!

00:17:18.610 --> 00:17:20.120
Use me!

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:22.090
Gotcha!

00:17:22.090 --> 00:17:23.680
W-Wait a minute!

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:29.130
All right, let's go!

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:31.380
Lightning...

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:34.190
Chii-chan, you're using a special move right away?!

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:36.820
...Cyan Spike!

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.580
This feels great!

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:46.770
All right, attack the main body next.

00:17:46.770 --> 00:17:48.320
We're going too!

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:50.380
Fly!

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:57.050
Cyan Spike!

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:58.420
Cyan Spike!

00:17:58.420 --> 00:18:00.390
Cyan Spike!

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:02.540
All right, I can do this too!

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:08.980
Y-You're kidding me!

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:28.670
Senpai!

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:32.710
Don't get in over your head!

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:35.510
Splash Stinger!

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:40.590
We'll run out of bullets!

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:46.680
I see, that thing-

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:55.530
Splash Stinger!

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:02.510
Chii-chan...

00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:03.520
The bullets...

00:19:04.360 --> 00:19:05.680
I'm out of bullets...

00:19:05.680 --> 00:19:07.150
Let me rest...

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:09.250
Come on, don't be so useless.

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:12.050
And what are you spacing out for, Haru?

00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:13.360
I noticed something.

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:15.870
Her turning speed isn't very fast.

00:19:16.440 --> 00:19:18.600
If we make use of our mobility...

00:19:18.600 --> 00:19:20.590
Hurry up and let our master know!

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:24.060
But I'm sure Senpai already knows that.

00:19:24.060 --> 00:19:26.550
She doesn't need me to tell her.

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:29.150
And all I did was notice it.

00:19:29.150 --> 00:19:31.980
I didn't come up with a countermeasure-

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:37.530
Stop talking so much and go to where Senpai is, Haru!

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:39.530
Senpai is a girl, you know.

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:45.480
There are times when she'd want a guy to lead her confidently and order her around!

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:47.410
That's easy to say, but...

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:48.700
Chii-chan, your left!

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:51.240
You're not getting away!

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:53.970
Chii-chan, above you!

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:54.630
Got it!

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:58.600
I see.

00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:01.090
If Senpai could move freely in mid-air...

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:02.340
Go, Haru!

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:06.350
Otherwise I won't let you have my mom's cooking again!

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:07.760
I understand.

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:09.690
Thank you, Chiyu, Taku.

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:21.640
Haruyuki-kun?

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:24.530
You can't beat her using only physical attacks.

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:28.390
You need the speed to exploit openings in her movement!

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:31.280
So I need to strike when she slows down while turning.

00:20:31.280 --> 00:20:32.500
Exactly right, Senpai!

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:34.500
But how?

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:38.130
Gravity may be weak here, but
she still has the advantage mid-air.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:40.510
I'll become your wings!

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:41.840
So, S-

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:45.260
Senpai, just focus on the physical attacks!

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:47.150
Believe in me!

00:20:49.420 --> 00:20:50.640
What is it?

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:53.640
You finally talked to me straight.

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:59.070
I-I don't think my tiny wings will help very much though...

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:02.190
This space is just like Brain Burst.

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:05.090
Imagination-incarnation-works here.

00:21:05.090 --> 00:21:07.530
Thus, your thoughts are your power.

00:21:08.550 --> 00:21:10.240
What is it that you want?

00:21:11.440 --> 00:21:13.500
<i>What I want right now...</i>

00:21:14.030 --> 00:21:15.210
<i>It's...</i>

00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:21.590
<i>I want to fly with Senpai!</i>

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:31.160
Let's go, Senpai!

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:32.060
Yeah!

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:33.860
What?!

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:38.480
This is incredible!

00:21:41.060 --> 00:21:45.840
It's so wonderful to fly with your own wings!

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:52.120
Here she comes!

00:22:14.680 --> 00:22:17.120
Now!

00:22:28.420 --> 00:22:28.950
Hey.

00:22:34.250 --> 00:22:36.310
Now it can end.

00:22:46.190 --> 00:22:47.660
Master, this is...

00:22:47.660 --> 00:22:49.050
The field is disintegrating.

00:22:50.330 --> 00:22:51.530
This way.

00:22:56.520 --> 00:22:57.850
A gate!

00:22:57.850 --> 00:22:58.980
Let's go.

00:22:58.980 --> 00:23:01.280
Chii-chan, I can't go much further.

00:23:01.280 --> 00:23:02.750
I'm out of gas.

00:23:02.750 --> 00:23:05.220
Come on, one last effort.

00:23:05.220 --> 00:23:08.260
You really overwork people, geez!

00:23:08.260 --> 00:23:09.910
Just hang in there.

00:23:34.550 --> 00:23:35.760
What's the matter?

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:38.570
W-Well, uh...

00:23:38.570 --> 00:23:40.720
I was just thinking about her.

00:23:42.580 --> 00:23:44.190
About Dushka.

00:23:44.190 --> 00:23:46.290
It's kind of sad.

00:23:46.840 --> 00:23:51.200
She had been waiting for a duel opponent on an abandoned server for so long.

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:55.940
And in the end, it felt like the closing of a game that had lost all its popularity.

00:23:55.940 --> 00:23:56.930
I wonder.

00:23:56.930 --> 00:24:03.380
When I defeated her, I felt the fulfilling sadness that comes from properly beating a game.

00:24:04.650 --> 00:24:07.850
I'm sure she felt the same way.

00:24:09.810 --> 00:24:11.680
I hope so.

00:24:12.310 --> 00:24:13.110
Yeah.

00:24:14.050 --> 00:24:15.770
By the way, Haruyuki-kun.

00:24:15.770 --> 00:24:18.140
When we had the union towards the end...

00:24:18.140 --> 00:24:22.480
You seemed to be trying something but then backed off.

00:24:26.480 --> 00:24:27.750
So, S-

00:24:27.750 --> 00:24:29.650
Senpai...

00:24:29.650 --> 00:24:31.900
S-Sorry!

00:24:31.900 --> 00:24:34.400
I was just caught in the moment...

00:24:34.400 --> 00:24:36.310
Just testing my courage...

00:24:38.710 --> 00:24:39.650
But...

00:24:41.300 --> 00:24:44.600
Someday, when I have enough courage...

00:24:44.600 --> 00:24:46.270
Please let me call you...

00:24:46.940 --> 00:24:49.840
...by your real name!

00:24:51.220 --> 00:24:52.270
All right.

00:24:52.880 --> 00:24:55.950
Until then, you can call me Kuroyukihime.

00:24:56.490 --> 00:24:57.510
Okay!
